        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "If I could give it zero stars .1st\nThis pipeline is used as a truck parking yard,\nit's so bad,\nthere are drop trailers and sometimes you can't even get into fuel lines for fuel up .I  Have complained to the regional manager  so many times they still didn't do anything about the drop  trailers and people blocking the parking  spot with their cars . And whenever you fuel up you won't get a receipt as the people working here are so lazy they can't even put a receipt roller in pumps . Winter or summer you will never find windshield cleaner here . Review updated added this review last week see new pictures also drop trailers bob tail truck",
        "time": 1727725691,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "karanpreet singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101726246618659752458/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLqQbRsSh3h7212DAH2mhF-yQxoPiJ4c44YrpSnCAfW_HOXxA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Finally took an action needed that\nProblem solved 🫡\nBut after some week  thing happens again\nUnattended trailers",
        "time": 1742068587,
