        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV43TZBJdS7IqXSXx173Ssh0N-znbostjXm1W-1FiWK_NMxQASW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "i bet would have given negative reviews! when fuels elsewhere have been 2.35 this pump becomes smart to price diesel at 3$ later on claiming it to be a glitch in system. and still charging you 3$",
        "time": 1653922593,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mark DeBoer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107791749231873340364/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwom0Svm6orezY-AbXtmqKl9v4ZzwmYxukkSjYwfeZfBtB5WpM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "This Pipeline is a disgrace to the name brand. Pumps are always broken, hoses leak diesel, printers never work, truckers drop trailers here and leave them (and judging by the accumulation of snow on the trailers, they’ve been there awhile), truckers are allowed to park any which way they choose, blocking access to certain pumps, snow is never cleared properly, and the windshield wash buckets never have any juice in them.\n\nI’ve been lobbying my company to switch to PetroPass and will continue to do so.",
        "time": 1741004449,
        "translated": false
      },
